config BR2_PACKAGE_BRICK_KMODS
	bool "brick-kmods"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  The TrimUI Brick's kernel modules, into /usr/lib/brick, where
	  /etc/init.d/brick loads them: the gamepad (brick-pad.ko) and
	  the GPU's kernel driver (pvrsrvkm.ko, dc_sunxi.ko,
	  Imagination's DDK 1.11 kernel half, dual MIT/GPL).

	  Built outside Buildroot with the kernel they belong to
	  (carapace, by its brick-spike/runtime/export-modules.sh) and
	  taken from a folder mounted at /brick-modules (see the
	  Makefile): the Brick's Allwinner 4.9 kernel builds with GCC 10,
	  not this toolchain's.
